reat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198096187586/", "num_games_owned": 164, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 2733, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 478, "last_played": 1760134779, "avatar": "f50c4bec062ebc2ae5d0ed9fcc6c50f8be8fd511"}, "language": "english", "review": "Do you want to conquer alien worlds, all while facing ever increasing hordes of enemies, a giant boss, finding treasures and grow stronger with each item you find ? Yes ? Buy Risk of Rain, I have never felt so much satisfaction to kill a boss or even just a specific mob that had been troublesome before.\nIf you need a challenge or something to play in between breaks,risk of rain can provide both and be great fun any time.", "timestamp_created": 1513318554, "timestamp_updated": 1513318554, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "38314963", "author": {"steamid": "76561198353144651", "personaname": "UltraChode", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Really-Fat-Cock/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3379, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1606, "last_played": 1613272726, "avatar": "c260e01d38f8f2c670c84ca55f5a3a9687e90610"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is great, not only are there a multitude of characters and artifact to keep you interested every run is different and even though it gets annoying to die a lot when you start eventually you'll get that one run which peaks interest in the game and helps unlock more artifacts and or characters. The only problem is the multiplayer, portforwarding? Really? It's just too much hassle even with the new issue which gives friends joining your game an error message. Either way I'm still excited for the second one and hope these issues are fixed by then", "timestamp_created": 1513307097, "timestamp_updated": 1513307097, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "38293639", "author": {"steamid": "76561198050215571", "personaname": "zoei", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lilfibb/", "num_games_owned": 466, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 8700, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5738, "last_played": 1630903190, "avatar": "02903068c2f8f3525e5aa58b3faccc3a93cae10a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Lets see here....\n\n+Good graphics\n+good music\n+good enemies\n+good colors\n\nYeah looks like a real game of the World award to me", "timestamp_created": 1513223032, "timestamp_updated": 1513223032, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.487634152173995972", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}